&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;
		&lt;ol&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;What is this PR for?&lt;br/&gt;
    In the karma-conf.js file, dependencies are usually alphabetically ordered.&lt;br/&gt;
    On a clean repo build, the file is changed to be alphabetically order those dependencies.&lt;br/&gt;
    SInce one of those is not in the right order, it creates a modified file in the repository after build.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ol&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;    This PR is simply re-ordering the file so that there is no modifications on build.&lt;/p&gt;


